        "math-deriv-sum-product"
      ],
      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "求 $f(x) = \\frac{2x + 1}{x - 3}$的导数。",
      "answer": "$f'(x) = \\frac{-7}{(x - 3)^2}$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "设 u = 2x + 1, v = x - 3",
        "u' = 2, v' = 1",
        "除法法则：$f'(x) = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$",
        "$= \\frac{2(x-3) - (2x+1)\\cdot 1}{(x-3)^2}$",
        "$= \\frac{2x - 6 - 2x - 1}{(x-3)^2} = \\frac{-7}{(x-3)^2}$"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "除法法则的分子是 u'v - uv' 还是 uv' - u'v？"
        },
