        "math-deriv-chain"
      ],
      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "content": "用对数求导法求 $y = x^x (x > 0)$的导数。",
      "answer": "$y' = x^x(\\ln x + 1)$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "取对数：ln y = x ln x",
        "两边对 $x$求导：$(\\frac{1}{y})\\cdot y' = \\ln x + x\\cdot(\\frac{1}{x}) = \\ln x + 1$",
        "$y' = y(\\ln x + 1) = x^x(\\ln x + 1)$"
      ],
      "hints": [
